Whitney Hodges: Yeah. So, um, I always thought that that was just, like, a formatting thing, like, a thing that was like, okay, let me decide how big I want this to look on the page. Well, it's actually… maybe you already know this… it's actually an SEO thing, and a…

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.000
Tina Henares: Oh.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:19.000
Whitney Hodges: page should only have one heading 1 on it. Um, and so when I look at, like, our existing weddingindustryads.com landing page, I think we have, like, probably, like, 10 heading 1s, sort of thing. And so that's, like, what's communicating to Google and to the search engines.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.000
