Whitney Hodges: um, like, the importance of, like, what these, like, words are, sort of thing. So that'll definitely be something you'll want to be, like, looking at as you're designing the page, right? Like, we don't want to make everything a Heading 1 just because it's big and, like, the size we want it to be. It needs to be, like.

